--- note
## The claim
The report's bottom line: Gemma 4 is "a leap in performance across STEM, multimodal, and long-context
benchmarks, and rivals larger, frontier open models in human-rated tasks." The strongest single
data-point is human preference (Arena): **Gemma 4 31B is the leading *dense* open model** and both 31B
and 26B-A4B score on par with **much larger** open MoE models. We unpack every benchmark in **g410**.
